---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Meet Timi Olayinka — Enterprise Data Architect behind BellosData, with experience at major UK retailers including Holland & Barrett and Boohoo Group.">

	<!-- Hero -->
	<section class="about-hero container section-padding">
		<div class="about-hero-grid">
			<div class="profile-block">
				<div class="profile-img-wrapper">
					<img src="/images/profile.png" alt="Timi Olayinka — Founder of BellosData" class="profile-img" />
					<div class="profile-glow"></div>
				</div>
				<div class="profile-badges">
					<span class="badge-cert">AWS Certified Data Engineer</span>
					<span class="badge-cert">AWS Solution Architect</span>
					<span class="badge-cert">CDMP Certified</span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="about-intro">
				<span class="badge">The Person Behind the Data</span>
				<h1>Hi, I'm <span class="gold-accent">Timi Olayinka.</span></h1>
				<p class="intro-lead">
					Enterprise Data Architect and the founder of BellosData. Over the last 5+ years I've designed and delivered scalable data infrastructure for some of the UK's most recognised retail and e-commerce brands — turning raw, complex data into the reliable foundations that power real business growth.
				</p>
				<p class="intro-body">
					My work sits at the intersection of technical precision and strategic thinking. Whether it's migrating a legacy warehouse to the cloud, building real-time pipelines, or establishing a governance framework your team can actually trust — I deliver solutions that are robust, future-ready, and built to last.
				</p>
				<div class="hero-actions">
					<a href="mailto:contact@bellosdata.co.uk" class="btn-main">Work With Me</a>
					<a href="/#services" class="btn-secondary">View Services</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- UK Retailer Experience -->
	<section class="experience-section container section-padding">
		<div class="section-header">
			<h2 class="text-gradient">Enterprise Experience</h2>
			<span class="gold-accent section-sub">UK's Leading Retailers & Brands</span>
		</div>

		<div class="timeline">

			<div class="timeline-item glass">
				<div class="timeline-meta">
					<span class="timeline-period">June 2024 — Present</span>
					<span class="timeline-role">Data Warehouse Engineer</span>
				</div>
				<div class="timeline-content">
					<div class="company-header">
						<div class="company-dot"></div>
						<h3>Holland &amp; Barrett</h3>
						<span class="company-tag">UK Health &amp; Wellness Retail</span>
					</div>
					<p>Engineered the enterprise Redshift Data Warehouse end-to-end — from raw ingestion through to BI-ready application layers — using Kimball methodology and Medallion Architecture. Built SQL data models consolidating hundreds of disparate data sources into a single source of truth, and championed data governance frameworks that enabled trusted, managed self-service analytics across the business.</p>
					<div class="tags">
						<span>Redshift</span><span>Kimball</span><span>Medallion Architecture</span><span>Data Governance</span><span>ETL/ELT</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="timeline-item glass">
				<div class="timeline-meta">
					<span class="timeline-period">Oct 2022 — May 2024</span>
					<span class="timeline-role">Data Engineer</span>
				</div>
				<div class="timeline-content">
					<div class="company-header">
						<div class="company-dot"></div>
						<h3>Boohoo Group</h3>
						<span class="company-tag">Global Fashion E-Commerce</span>
					</div>
					<p>Designed and delivered end-to-end data pipelines extracting from multiple supply chain systems into Google BigQuery, enabling real-time and batch analytics at scale. Led the cloud migration of legacy SQL Server and Oracle warehouses to GCP, engineering cloud-native solutions with continuous analytics for enterprise reporting across the Boohoo brand portfolio.</p>
					<div class="tags">
						<span>GCP</span><span>BigQuery</span><span>Cloud Migration</span><span>Real-Time Pipelines</span><span>Python</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="timeline-item glass">
				<div class="timeline-meta">
					<span class="timeline-period">Sept 2021 — Oct 2022</span>
					<span class="timeline-role">Analytics Engineer</span>
				</div>
				<div class="timeline-content">
					<div class="company-header">
						<div class="company-dot"></div>
						<h3>The Hut Group (THG)</h3>
						<span class="company-tag">Global D2C E-Commerce &amp; Logistics</span>
					</div>
					<p>Built robust ETL pipelines unifying data from THG's AI-powered fulfilment systems (THG Ingenuity Fulfil) into a centralised Data Vault, enabling operational intelligence for global B2C logistics. Delivered advanced SQL data models and comprehensive Tableau reports directly consumed by C-suite stakeholders for strategic decision-making.</p>
					<div class="tags">
						<span>Data Vault</span><span>Tableau</span><span>SQL</span><span>ETL</span><span>Global Logistics</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Skills & Credentials -->
	<section class="credentials-section container section-padding">
		<div class="creds-grid">
			<div class="creds-col">
				<h2 class="gold-accent">Skills &amp; Stack</h2>
				<div class="skills-list">
					<div class="skill-row"><span class="skill-name">Cloud Platforms</span><span class="skill-val">AWS · GCP</span></div>
					<div class="skill-row"><span class="skill-name">Data Warehouses</span><span class="skill-val">Redshift · BigQuery · Snowflake</span></div>
					<div class="skill-row"><span class="skill-name">Languages</span><span class="skill-val">SQL · Python</span></div>
					<div class="skill-row"><span class="skill-name">Modelling</span><span class="skill-val">Kimball · Data Vault · Medallion</span></div>
					<div class="skill-row"><span class="skill-name">Orchestration</span><span class="skill-val">Airflow · dbt · Fivetran · SSIS</span></div>
					<div class="skill-row"><span class="skill-name">Visualisation</span><span class="skill-val">Power BI · Tableau · Looker</span></div>
					<div class="skill-row"><span class="skill-name">Architecture</span><span class="skill-val">Enterprise Data Architecture · TOGAF</span></div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="creds-col">
				<h2 class="gold-accent">Certifications</h2>
				<div class="cert-list">
					<div class="cert-item glass">
						<span class="cert-icon">🏅</span>
						<div>
							<strong>AWS Certified Data Engineer — Associate</strong>
							<p>Amazon Web Services</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="cert-item glass">
						<span class="cert-icon">🏅</span>
						<div>
							<strong>AWS Certified Solution Architect — Associate</strong>
							<p>Amazon Web Services</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="cert-item glass">
						<span class="cert-icon">🏅</span>
						<div>
							<strong>CDMP Certified — Associate</strong>
							<p>DAMA UK Member</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="cert-item glass">
						<span class="cert-icon">🏅</span>
						<div>
							<strong>PCAP-31-03 — Python Programming</strong>
							<p>Python Institute</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="cert-item glass">
						<span class="cert-icon">🎓</span>
						<div>
							<strong>MSc Digital Marketing — Distinction</strong>
							<p>University of Kent</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- CTA -->
	<section class="cta-section container">
		<div class="cta-box glass">
			<h2 class="text-gradient">Ready to engineer your data?</h2>
			<p>Let's talk about what BellosData can build for your organisation.</p>
			<a href="mailto:contact@bellosdata.co.uk" class="btn-main">Get In Touch</a>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>

<style>
	/* Hero */
	.about-hero-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 380px 1fr;
		gap: 6rem;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.profile-block {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.profile-img-wrapper {
		position: relative;
		width: 320px;
		height: 320px;
	}

	.profile-img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: top center;
		border-radius: 50%;
		border: 2px solid var(--accent-gold);
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
	}

	.profile-glow {
		position: absolute;
		inset: -10px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(212,175,55,0.2) 0%, transparent 70%);
		z-index: 0;
	}

	.profile-badges {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		align-items: center;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.badge-cert {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		text-align: center;
		padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
		background: var(--accent-gold-soft);
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		border-radius: 0.4rem;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
	}

	.badge {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
		background: var(--accent-gold-soft);
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		border-radius: 2rem;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		line-height: 1.1;
	}

	.intro-lead {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.intro-body {
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.hero-actions {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.btn-main {
		padding: 1rem 2rem;
		background: var(--accent-gold);
		color: var(--bg-color);
		font-weight: 700;
		border-radius: 0.5rem;
		transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
	}
	.btn-main:hover { opacity: 0.85; }

	.btn-secondary {
		padding: 1rem 2rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
		color: var(--text-primary);
		font-weight: 600;
		border-radius: 0.5rem;
	}
	.btn-secondary:hover { background: var(--glass-bg); }

	/* Section header */
	.section-header {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: flex-end;
		margin-bottom: 4rem;
	}

	.section-header h2 {
		font-size: 3rem;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.section-sub {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
	}

	/* Timeline */
	.timeline {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.timeline-item {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
		gap: 3rem;
		padding: 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.timeline-item:hover {
		border-color: var(--accent-gold-soft);
	}

	.timeline-meta {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding-top: 0.25rem;
	}

	.timeline-period {
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
	}

	.timeline-role {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.company-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.company-dot {
		width: 10px;
		height: 10px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--accent-gold);
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.company-header h3 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.company-tag {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		background: var(--glass-bg);
		border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
		padding: 0.2rem 0.7rem;
		border-radius: 2rem;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.timeline-content p {
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		line-height: 1.8;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.tags {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	.tags span {
		padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
		background: var(--accent-gold-soft);
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		border-radius: 2rem;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	/* Skills & Certs */
	.creds-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 6rem;
	}

	.creds-col h2 {
		font-size: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.skills-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.skill-row {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 0.75rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
	}

	.skill-name {
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
	}

	.skill-val {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		text-align: right;
	}

	.cert-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.cert-item {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
	}

	.cert-icon {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.cert-item strong {
		display: block;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
	}

	.cert-item p {
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin: 0;
	}

	/* CTA */
	.cta-section {
		padding-bottom: 8rem;
	}

	.cta-box {
		padding: 5rem;
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		text-align: center;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.cta-box h2 {
		font-size: 3rem;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.cta-box p {
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin: 0;
	}

	/* Responsive */
	@media (max-width: 1024px) {
		.about-hero-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 3rem;
		}
		.profile-block {
			flex-direction: row;
			align-items: flex-start;
		}
		.profile-img-wrapper {
			width: 180px;
			height: 180px;
			flex-shrink: 0;
		}
		.timeline-item {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1rem;
		}
		.creds-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 4rem;
		}
		.cta-box {
			padding: 3rem;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.profile-block {
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: center;
		}
		.hero-actions {
			flex-direction: column;
		}
		.section-header {
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: flex-start;
			gap: 0.5rem;
		}
		.company-header {
			flex-wrap: wrap;
		}
	}
</style>
